# Verilog If & Case Constructs

## Overview
A compact Verilog RTL project demonstrating conditional
logic using if-else and case constructs.

## Topics
- if / else
- case
- default case
- Conditional RTL coding

## Project Structure
rtl/ → Verilog designs
tb/  → Testbench

## Key Learning
- Use if-else for priority-based conditions.
- Use case for multiple mutually exclusive choices.
- Always consider a default condition in combinational logic.

## Tools
- Verilog
- Icarus Verilog
- GTKWave

## Result
Successfully verified if and case behavior through simulation.
